# Building a Personal Research Infrastructure

For a long time I used Kali Linux mainly for CTF challenges and labs.

Today my goal is different.

I am interested in building a long-term research environment focused on:

- Linux
- Security Research
- JavaScriptCore
- Fuzzing
- Automation
- Engineering Infrastructure

The operating system is only one part of the ecosystem.

The more important goal is creating workflows, documentation and reusable tools.

Current areas of work:

- exploit-dev-auto
- CUDA JSC Fuzzer
- Personal engineering website
- Research notes and documentation

This website serves as a place to document ideas, experiments and ongoing projects.
